Title:  Amount

Seq:    5.16.1

Level:  4 - chunk

Class:  non-version

Index:  budgeting; amount; 

Timestamp: 20261030182237

Body:

The word `Amount` can be used as a label, but not as a type.

An amount field can be used to hold a currency value, for use in [[budgeting]]. 

It is best used in combination with a field of type [[Spread]]. 
